msgid "ReliefNT 5.3.3"
msgstr "ReliefNT 5.3.3"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"新增 Realtek RTL8111/8168 千兆和 RTL8125 2.5GbE PCIe 网卡驱动，各设备独立维护资源和网络接口，并提供内置及 ``r8169.ko`` "
"配置。实际支持范围取决于芯片版本，见 Realtek 驱动手册。"
msgstr ""
"Added Realtek RTL8111/8168 Gigabit and RTL8125 2.5GbE PCIe Ethernet drivers. Devices maintain "
"independent resources and interfaces, with built-in and ``r8169.ko`` configurations. Supported "
"hardware depends on the chip revision; see the Realtek driver manual."

msgid ""
"新增 VMXNET3 驱动，支持 PCI ``15ad:07b0``、revision 1 和 UPT 1，可内置或构建为 ``vmxnet3.ko``。每个设备独立运行一对发送、接收队列，使用"
" 1500 字节 MTU、软件校验和与轮询完成。"
msgstr ""
"Added VMXNET3 support for PCI ``15ad:07b0``, revision 1 and UPT 1, either built in or as "
"``vmxnet3.ko``. Each device uses one independent transmit/receive queue pair, a 1500-byte MTU, "
"software checksums and polling completions."

msgid "网络栈支持多个独立接口，将地址、路由、ARP、IPv6 邻居发现及传输路径接入相应设备，减少多网卡状态互相覆盖的问题。"
msgstr ""
"The network stack supports multiple independent interfaces, associating addresses, routes, ARP, "
"IPv6 neighbor discovery and transport paths with the appropriate device to reduce state "
"collisions between interfaces."

msgid ""
"新增 ext3 文件系统前端、``ext3.ko`` 和原生格式化器，复用 ext 引擎处理经典块映射、内部 JBD 日志及 ordered "
"数据模式。补齐文件系统探测、挂载、重挂载、日志恢复与模块所有权。"
msgstr ""
"Added an ext3 filesystem frontend, ``ext3.ko`` and a native formatter. The shared ext engine "
"handles classic block mapping, internal JBD journaling and ordered data mode. Filesystem "
"detection, mounting, remounting, recovery and module ownership are integrated."

msgid "块设备导出可移动卷身份，FAT 支持挂载权限选项，为用户态挂载和安全弹出提供基础。procfs 文件描述符枚举保留匿名描述符，避免目录遍历遗漏仍打开的资源。"
msgstr ""
"Block devices expose removable-volume identity, and FAT supports mount permission options for "
"userspace mounting and safe eject. procfs descriptor enumeration retains anonymous descriptors so"
" directory traversal does not omit open resources."

msgid "控制台补齐 ncurses 输入和虚拟终端状态处理，修复 Shell 通过退格及方向键移动光标时文字被意外擦除的问题。"
msgstr ""
"The console now handles ncurses input and virtual-terminal state more completely, fixing "
"unintended text erasure when the shell moves the cursor using backspace or arrow keys."

msgid "内核手册增加英文和日文版本；移除已退役的内核诊断模式、独立载荷、私有控制 ABI 及构建清单，保留普通符号文件和 debug profile。"
msgstr ""
"Added English and Japanese kernel manuals. Removed the retired kernel diagnostic mode, standalone"
" payload, private control ABI and build inventories, while retaining normal symbol files and the "
"debug profile."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid ""
"**是，涉及私有诊断 ABI、构建产物和内核模块配套。** 不再提供 ``kerneldebug.sys`` 和旧诊断控制接口；依赖这些接口的工具或安装清单需要迁移。内核内部接口并非稳定的 "
"Linux 二进制模块 ABI，旧 ``.ko``、``Module.symvers`` 和 prepared SDK 必须随本版重建。没有改变既有标准 syscall "
"编号，也不要求转换现有磁盘格式。"
msgstr ""
"**Yes: private diagnostic ABI, build products and matching kernel modules.** ``kerneldebug.sys`` "
"and the old diagnostic control interfaces are no longer provided. Dependent tools and "
"installation inventories must migrate. Internal kernel interfaces are not a stable Linux binary-"
"module ABI: rebuild old ``.ko`` files, ``Module.symvers`` and prepared SDKs for this release. "
"Existing standard syscall numbers are unchanged, and existing disk formats do not require "
"conversion."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Upgrade and migration notes"

msgid ""
"本次为**源码 Release**，只提供标签和 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附预编译内核、模块、SDK 或镜像。对现有配置执行 ``olddefconfig``，并使用同一版本的内核、模块和"
" initramfs；默认配置仍将生产驱动内置。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **source release**, containing a tag and GitHub-generated source archives only. No "
"prebuilt kernel, module, SDK or image is attached. Run ``olddefconfig`` on existing "
"configurations, and use matching kernel, modules and initramfs. Production drivers remain built "
"in by default."

msgid ""
"VMXNET3 当前不启用硬件校验和、分段、VLAN 剥离、RSS 或 LRO；QEMU 的设备模型和宿主驱动模型验证不代表 VMware 平台验收。Realtek "
"不承诺覆盖全部同名芯片版本，实体网卡仍需按具体设备验证。"
msgstr ""
"VMXNET3 currently does not enable hardware checksums, segmentation, VLAN stripping, RSS or LRO. "
"QEMU device-model and host driver-model checks do not validate VMware operation. Realtek support "
"does not cover every revision sharing a marketing name; validate physical adapters individually."

msgid ""
"ext3 支持内部日志和 ``data=ordered``，不提供外部日志或任意 ext4 扩展的兼容承诺。原生格式化器使用 128 字节 inode，时间戳受 2038 "
"年边界限制；格式化会破坏目标数据，使用前须备份。"
msgstr ""
"ext3 supports an internal journal and ``data=ordered``; external journals and arbitrary ext4 "
"extensions are not promised. The native formatter uses 128-byte inodes with a 2038 timestamp "
"boundary. Formatting destroys target data; back up before use."

msgid ""
"发行定向检查覆盖版本生成、基础与附加版本字符串、数字宏、无操作重生成和 procfs 回归，以及中英日文档。本次未重新编译完整内核、打包或执行 QEMU 整版回归；**VMware "
"验证未完成**，实体硬件和长期稳定性尚未完成本版验收。"
msgstr ""
"Targeted release checks cover version generation, base and suffixed version strings, numeric "
"macros, no-op regeneration, procfs regression and Chinese, English and Japanese manuals. The full"
" kernel was not rebuilt, packaged or subjected to a complete QEMU release regression. **VMware "
"validation remains incomplete**; physical hardware and long-term stability have not completed "
"release acceptance."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"``configs/build-version`` 为 **5.3.3**，生成数字字段为 **5/3/3**；EXTRAVERSION、LOCALVERSION 和模块 ABI "
"后缀仍独立处理，并遵守完整 release 字符串长度限制。"
msgstr ""
"``configs/build-version`` is **5.3.3**, and generated numeric fields are **5/3/3**. EXTRAVERSION,"
" LOCALVERSION and module ABI suffixes remain separate and must obey the full release-string "
"length limit."

msgid "驱动、文件系统、UAPI、内核测试及对应手册归本仓；ReliefOS 的安装器、应用、打包和系统集成独立发布。保留 ABI golden 与音频策略，不以修改基线掩盖失败。"
msgstr ""
"This repository owns drivers, filesystems, UAPI, kernel tests and their manuals. ReliefOS "
"publishes the installer, applications, packaging and system integration separately. ABI golden "
"data and audio policy remain unchanged; baselines are not changed to conceal failures."

msgid ""
"本次范围为上一版本提交 **1dfd1eb8541bb31e51836aab40827694eb82fed2** 之后至本次 5.3.3 版本提交；仅汇总内核仓最终生效内容，排除 "
"ReliefOS 应用、打包与纯合并。下一版以本次版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"This release covers commits after the previous version commit "
"**1dfd1eb8541bb31e51836aab40827694eb82fed2** through the 5.3.3 version commit. It summarizes only"
" effective kernel-repository changes, excluding ReliefOS applications, packaging and pure merges."
" The next release starts from this version commit."
